      "reason" : "MOST_NOSTALGIC_DAY",
      "title" : "The day you let a sunny playlist turn back the clock",
      "description" : "Afternoon rolled in with “Lovely Day” and “Amber,” then the “Sunny Day” playlist carried you through a parade of 90s and early 2000s classics—Third Eye Blind, The Cranberries, and Jimmy Buffett all making cameos. 156 minutes, 43 tracks, 41 artists—your most nostalgic day, sun-soaked and memory-rich.",
