    }, {
      "columnQualifier" : "20250729",
      "minutesListened" : 0,
      "reason" : "MOST_DIVERSE_DAY",
      "title" : "The day you DJed your own genre kaleidoscope",
      "description" : "Overnight, Pink Floyd and Daft Punk traded the stage, with Air, Modjo, and Tame Impala weaving in. By afternoon, jazz funk, city pop, and vaporwave joined the set, never repeating the same mood twice. 932 minutes, 217 tracks, 83 artists—your most diverse day, spanning 41 genres in one seamless arc.",
