      "minutesListened" : 0,
      "reason" : "BIGGEST_TOP_ARTIST_DAY",
      "title" : "The day you let Red Hot Chili Peppers soundtrack sunrise to midnight",
      "description" : "From an early jolt with Rage Against The Machine, the morning slipped into a full Blood Sugar Sex Magik run, then One Hot Minute took over the afternoon and late evening—Red Hot Chili Peppers on near-constant repeat. CAKE and Parcels broke the spell just before midnight. 240 minutes, 60 tracks, 9 artists—your most Chili Peppers-centric day of the year.",
      "filedUnderTags" : "[album immersion, Chili Peppers marathon]"
    }, {
