      "minutesListened" : 0,
      "reason" : "BIGGEST_MUSIC_LISTENING_DAY",
      "title" : "The day you ran a 1000-minute band relay through alt-rock history",
      "description" : "From late-night Beck and Primus, through sunrise with Nirvana and Led Zeppelin, you powered on into afternoon with Daft Punk and a funk-rock parade. Red Hot Chili Peppers and Queens of the Stone Age kept the pace, but Temple Of The Dog and Incubus never let up. 1000 minutes, 242 tracks, 54 artists—your most epic listening stretch all year.",
